---
// src/components/TheManifesto.astro
---
<section id="the-manifesto" class="manifesto-section">
  <div class="manifesto-container">
    
    <div class="manifesto-header" data-reveal>
      <span class="manifesto-tag">The Philosophy</span>
      <h2 class="manifesto-title">Before the Machine. <br>Beyond the Algorithm.</h2>
      
      <div class="manifesto-tribute">
        <p class="manifesto-stanza">
          From the first human hands that touched the soil, to the hands doing it today in the era of AI, an unbroken lineage exists.
        </p>
        <p class="manifesto-stanza">
          In every corner of the earth, indigenous communities have held a quiet ethos until their last breath: You do not take everything. You take only what the forest agrees to give.
        </p>
        <p class="manifesto-stanza">
          This is not a corporate supply chain. This is not a process document. This is an ancient intimacy with altitude, rainfall, and soil. 
        </p>
        <p class="manifesto-stanza">
          When you hold this yield, you are not holding a product. You are holding a decision made by a human being—days before a market ever asked for it. 
        </p>
        <p class="manifesto-stanza highlight">
          We do not own this ethos. We are simply trying to be worthy of it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .manifesto-section {
    position: relative;
    /* Blend seamlessly with OriginZone */
  }

  .manifesto-container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .manifesto-header {
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .manifesto-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    color: var(--color-gold);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .manifesto-title {
    font-family: var(--font-institutional);
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0 0 4rem 0;
    color: var(--color-warm-cream);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .manifesto-tribute {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3rem;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .manifesto-stanza {
    font-family: var(--font-narrative);
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 1.8vw, 1.6rem);
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: rgba(245, 237, 216, 0.7);
    margin: 0;
    transition: color 0.4s ease;
  }

  .manifesto-stanza:hover {
    color: rgba(245, 237, 216, 1);
  }

  .manifesto-stanza.highlight {
    font-family: var(--font-institutional);
    color: var(--color-gold);
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2vw, 1.8rem);
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2);
  }

  /* Mobile responsiveness */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .manifesto-tribute {
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
